WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:09.965
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Giri~

02:07.627 --> 02:11.563
Posture control ciear. Stealth
system level 5 has been applied.

02:12.465 --> 02:14.330
We're undetectable.

02:15.235 --> 02:17.362
Get final confirmation
for the humankind research...

02:17.470 --> 02:19.802
...from the interplanetary
life maintenance system.

02:20.140 --> 02:20.663
Roger.

02:24.744 --> 02:26.871
Kashimashi, Tokyo

02:29.883 --> 02:32.181
Kashima Mountain

02:33.686 --> 02:36.280
Kashima Mountain Trail

02:38.992 --> 02:40.789
Cacalia hastata...

02:41.828 --> 02:43.489
Cacalia delphinifolia...

02:43.663 --> 02:47.155
Schizophragma hydrangeoides...
Houttuynia cordata...

02:47.333 --> 02:49.494
Looks !like they're a!! doing good.

03:02.615 --> 03:04.048
Was it down there?

03:04.150 --> 03:07.642
The place where I had
a serious conversation with Yasuna...

03:10.490 --> 03:16.622
The Young Boy's Life
Changed That Day

03:17.163 --> 03:20.499
Kashima High School

03:20.500 --> 03:21.234
Kashima High School
On your mark!

03:21.234 --> 03:22.223
On your mark!

03:22.635 --> 03:23.829
Get set...

03:24.137 --> 03:25.069
Start!

03:30.944 --> 03:33.310
Tomari! Your time was good!

03:33.413 --> 03:34.380
Really?

03:34.647 --> 03:36.808
Then let's try it again!

04:15.488 --> 04:16.648
Ayuki!

04:17.924 --> 04:18.788
Asuta...

04:19.259 --> 04:22.160
Did you see
Hazumu by any chance?

04:22.428 --> 04:23.759
I didn't see him.

04:24.797 --> 04:26.094
I see...

04:26.432 --> 04:28.559
Hey, is something wrong?

04:28.868 --> 04:31.302
Huh? Oh, no. It's really nothing.

04:33.106 --> 04:35.597
Well, I'm heading over to the school.

04:35.742 --> 04:37.607
Thank you, Ayuki!

04:43.549 --> 04:44.743
Ouch...

04:45.318 --> 04:47.081
I fell again.

04:47.220 --> 04:49.154
Just like that time...

04:49.956 --> 04:51.617
lt was here.

04:56.763 --> 04:58.856
It happened right here.

05:02.101 --> 05:03.398
Ouch...

05:04.737 --> 05:06.864
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

05:07.674 --> 05:09.699
Hey, you are...

05:10.276 --> 05:11.868
Kamiizumi...

05:12.178 --> 05:14.476
Hazumu Osaragi...

05:17.417 --> 05:18.850
I'm sorry!

05:19.419 --> 05:22.946
I'm a member of the gardening club,
and I'm here to collect some plants.

05:23.056 --> 05:25.957
I got separated from my parents.

05:26.192 --> 05:28.023
Huh? Here?

05:28.127 --> 05:32.063
They say that the butterbur scape
is the best at this time of year.

05:32.198 --> 05:34.393
So we came to collect some.

05:35.001 --> 05:37.367
I know just the place for that.

05:37.770 --> 05:38.759
Really?

05:39.906 --> 05:40.702
Yeah.

05:46.512 --> 05:49.106
Not many people
know about this place.

05:52.352 --> 05:53.080
Here.

05:53.353 --> 05:54.547
Thank you.

05:56.089 --> 05:58.057
There's more down there.

05:58.758 --> 06:02.751
Let's bring back lots of it
and surprise your parents.

06:07.967 --> 06:11.061
You're like a girl, Osaragi...

06:11.270 --> 06:11.929
What?

06:12.105 --> 06:14.733
I'm sorry!
That was a bad thing to say!

06:15.007 --> 06:16.269
It's okay.

06:16.442 --> 06:20.242
People usually say the same thing.
They say I look like a girl.

06:20.380 --> 06:22.405
So don’t worry about it.

06:25.017 --> 06:26.718
Look how much I got.

06:26.719 --> 06:27.981
Look how much I got.
Thank you.

06:39.065 --> 06:40.692
Hazumu?

06:41.000 --> 06:41.762
Yeah.

06:41.968 --> 06:45.404
He wouldn't be here on
Sundays if there's no club activity.

06:45.505 --> 06:47.063
That's true, but...

06:47.173 --> 06:48.367
What's wrong?

06:48.508 --> 06:52.638
It's really nothing.
I just want to give him something.

06:53.045 --> 06:54.137
What?

06:54.547 --> 06:56.282
It's a secret between us guys.

06:56.282 --> 06:57.374
It's a secret between us guys.
I see...

06:58.484 --> 07:00.952
Did you go see Kamiizumi?

07:01.053 --> 07:01.712
What?

07:01.888 --> 07:02.650
No...

07:03.022 --> 07:07.584
They're always together these days.
She was just there at the flower bed...

07:07.994 --> 07:09.894
Huh? She's gone...

07:10.029 --> 07:11.656
Gather around, juniors!

07:11.764 --> 07:12.731
Coming!

07:13.132 --> 07:14.030
See ya.

07:14.267 --> 07:15.029
Yeah.

07:16.936 --> 07:20.565
Listen up, Hazumu.
Be a man and go for it!

07:20.873 --> 07:21.464
But...

07:21.607 --> 07:22.869
No buts!

07:23.075 --> 07:26.044
You're not a man if you can't
even confess your love to a girl!

07:26.145 --> 07:29.410
You want to have a serious
relationship with Kamiizumi, right?

07:29.582 --> 07:30.349
Well, yeah...

07:30.349 --> 07:32.146
Well, yeah...
That settles it!

07:32.552 --> 07:35.885
Don't worry. if she turns
you down, then I'll comfort you.

07:36.022 --> 07:39.617
I'll just use my special merchandise
to help you recover from a broken heart.

07:39.725 --> 07:40.749
But...

07:40.893 --> 07:43.293
Blah! Blah!

07:47.300 --> 07:51.100
Stop whining, Hazumu.
You're a man, right? Be confident.

07:51.604 --> 07:52.593
Tomari...

07:52.972 --> 07:54.872
If you like her, just tell her.

07:54.974 --> 07:56.566
That's right! Tell her!

08:03.549 --> 08:04.675
Hazumu.

08:05.218 --> 08:05.912
There!

08:06.085 --> 08:08.144
Hey, not bad.

08:08.521 --> 08:09.988
All right then!

08:10.089 --> 08:13.752
I think you should
really think about it.

08:14.160 --> 08:15.286
Ayuki...

08:16.429 --> 08:20.763
The courage to confess to her
or not, if she turns you down...

08:20.867 --> 08:23.995
...you two might
never be friends again.

08:24.971 --> 08:26.495
You're right.

08:26.639 --> 08:28.971
Do you think
you can deal with the pain?

08:30.076 --> 08:32.203
The rest is up to you.

08:32.545 --> 08:36.174
What's important is
your honest feelings...

09:03.476 --> 09:05.000
Hazumu?

09:09.782 --> 09:12.580
Were you surprised?

09:12.885 --> 09:15.513
Yeah, of course you were... Sorry...

09:15.621 --> 09:19.284
If you think I'm a nuisance,
then it's okay. Really, I understand.

09:19.926 --> 09:23.589
But if not,
then will you go out with me?

09:40.713 --> 09:41.839
I'm sorry!

09:42.715 --> 09:43.773
I'm sorry!

09:52.058 --> 09:55.186
I have to forget
about it... Everything...

09:55.595 --> 09:57.654
That's why I came here.

10:08.040 --> 10:10.600
Asuta? Yeah, he came to see me.

10:10.710 --> 10:12.644
Didn't he sound strange to you?

10:12.745 --> 10:14.269
Well, let's see...

10:14.380 --> 10:17.508
He said he was going
to give something to Hazumu...

10:18.451 --> 10:18.974
Huh?

10:22.755 --> 10:25.315
Asuta! Did you find Hazumu?

10:25.691 --> 10:26.749
Nope.

10:27.093 --> 10:29.527
He's not home either.

10:32.398 --> 10:35.492
Anyway, I'll try
again tomorrow. See ya!

10:35.601 --> 10:36.829
Wait a minute!

10:37.903 --> 10:40.098
What were you trying to give him?

10:41.807 --> 10:46.244
It's just a promise made
between us guys. It's nothing.

10:46.512 --> 10:49.413
Nothing? You mean this?

10:50.116 --> 10:52.107
Give me that! Give it back!

11:00.459 --> 11:01.726
You were gonna give this?

11:01.727 --> 11:02.625
You were gonna give this?
So what?

11:02.728 --> 11:04.963
You call this "a promise between guys"?

11:04.964 --> 11:05.953
You call this "a promise between guys"?
That's right!

11:06.065 --> 11:09.592
Don't show these things to Hazumu!

11:12.438 --> 11:14.702
Stop looking at them, Ayuki!

11:14.940 --> 11:19.707
Why're you doing this out of the blue?
Hazumu doesn't like this kind of thing.

11:19.845 --> 11:22.871
Well, I thought
he was feeling down, so...

11:22.982 --> 11:23.782
Feeling down?

11:23.783 --> 11:25.876
Feeling down?
Oh, it's nothing.

11:25.985 --> 11:26.883
Asuta!

11:27.353 --> 11:29.321
Oh, all right then!

11:30.322 --> 11:31.789
Don't tell the others.

11:31.957 --> 11:32.616
Okay.

11:34.060 --> 11:36.426
Hazumu was turned down...

11:37.730 --> 11:39.197
...by Kamiizumi.

12:05.124 --> 12:05.954
What's going on?

12:07.359 --> 12:09.520
Accident in
the third power reactor block.

12:09.895 --> 12:12.659
Fourth program is down.
Subsystem won’t start.

12:13.699 --> 12:18.193
Posture control down. We’ll crash
on Earth’s surface in 1287 seconds.

12:19.071 --> 12:21.232
Use <i>all</i> our power to fix the damage!

12:21.407 --> 12:23.466
We have to avoid
crashing at all costs!

12:31.383 --> 12:32.748
Hazumu!

12:33.085 --> 12:34.416
Hazumu!

12:34.620 --> 12:39.057
Of all the things tormented
people do... The worst-case scenario...

12:39.225 --> 12:40.157
Ayuki!

12:42.027 --> 12:44.188
We can't be crying like this!

12:44.296 --> 12:47.754
Let's contact the fire department...
no, the health center!

12:47.867 --> 12:50.461
Calm down! We should contact...

12:50.569 --> 12:52.230
...the funeral parlor!

12:55.441 --> 12:57.773
Hazumu!

12:59.178 --> 13:00.372
This is bad...

13:00.479 --> 13:03.073
They really love Hazumu.

13:03.415 --> 13:05.440
You can count on me!

13:06.252 --> 13:08.618
Hello, everyone!

13:10.222 --> 13:11.484
I'm Namiko!

13:11.757 --> 13:12.815
Prof?

13:13.025 --> 13:14.617
Miss Namiko?

13:14.760 --> 13:18.252
I came as soon as I heard
Hazumu went missing!

13:18.597 --> 13:23.694
My name is Namiko Tsuki! I'm 35
years old and never had a boyfriend...

13:23.803 --> 13:26.966
...but I devote all my time
to educating students.

13:27.072 --> 13:28.198
Professor!

13:28.307 --> 13:29.171
Professor!

13:29.275 --> 13:34.110
As Hazumu's home-room teacher,
I will go and find your son!

13:34.280 --> 13:35.381
Please find him.

13:35.381 --> 13:36.871
Please find him.
Please find him.

13:36.982 --> 13:40.315
Okay, I'm going!
I'm coming, Hazumu!

13:46.292 --> 13:48.556
Why is there a hole?

13:48.828 --> 13:52.229
Hazumu wanted to plant
a persimmon tree, so...

13:52.364 --> 13:53.524
So...

13:54.867 --> 13:55.856
I see.

13:56.035 --> 13:59.835
So? Hurry up and help me!

14:17.857 --> 14:21.122
I can't eat this
much butterbur scape.

14:21.260 --> 14:23.524
Huh? Primula...

14:23.929 --> 14:27.023
That's going to turn
into a pretty flower soon.

14:27.833 --> 14:31.098
I'll take it back and plant it
in the school's flower bed.

14:31.604 --> 14:34.368
I want to plant it
in the flower bed too.

14:34.540 --> 14:35.507
Can I?

14:35.708 --> 14:38.268
Of course!
Let's plant them together.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.775
Come on, Yasuna! Hurry!

14:44.350 --> 14:45.214
Look!

14:48.754 --> 14:50.221
Blooming...

14:50.923 --> 14:53.187
They're blooming, Hazumu!

14:53.292 --> 14:56.523
It was worth giving them
water every day, wasn't it?

14:56.795 --> 14:57.591
Yeah!

14:58.697 --> 15:03.293
My flowers are
blooming right by yours...

15:03.969 --> 15:05.527
They're so pretty!

15:05.671 --> 15:06.501
Yeah.

15:19.485 --> 15:22.079
I'm all alone again.

15:36.969 --> 15:39.130
Nope. He's not here either.

15:39.638 --> 15:41.071
Where could he be?

15:41.173 --> 15:44.574
We checked all the places
where Hazumu might go, right?

15:44.710 --> 15:45.870
Let's see...

15:46.078 --> 15:48.546
We haven't checked the mountains.

15:49.548 --> 15:52.608
You shouldn't worry
too much, you know.

15:53.385 --> 15:57.378
I'm sure he'll come back
happy after crying a lot.

15:57.823 --> 16:00.121
I'm getting hungry, so let's just...

16:00.292 --> 16:03.125
You idiot!
Why can't you understand?

16:03.262 --> 16:07.164
Unlike you,
he's very delicate! He's easily hurt!

16:07.299 --> 16:10.234
He's been like that
ever since he was little!

16:10.336 --> 16:10.927
Tomari...

16:11.704 --> 16:16.903
Right now, he's suffering and probably
wandering around somewhere...

16:17.142 --> 16:19.269
That's the kind of guy he is.

16:21.780 --> 16:23.008
Hazumu...

16:23.749 --> 16:26.013
if something happens to Hazumu...

16:26.151 --> 16:27.140
I'm sorry.

16:27.252 --> 16:31.450
He really liked Kamiizumi, but...

16:31.790 --> 16:33.781
I said I'm sorry!

16:33.892 --> 16:34.916
No!

16:36.261 --> 16:40.721
I provoked him too.
I kept telling him to ask her out.

16:40.833 --> 16:44.360
So you'd be able to stop loving him?

16:59.485 --> 17:03.285
North American
Aerospace Defense Command

17:45.831 --> 17:48.561
I wonder where Yasuna's house is...

17:49.001 --> 17:52.300
Stupid, stupid! Why am I
trying to remember all this?

17:52.571 --> 17:55.768
Forget it! Forget it!
I have to act like a real man!

17:56.975 --> 17:58.340
Shooting star?

17:58.710 --> 17:59.699
I know!

17:59.912 --> 18:01.777
I wish I can fall in love again.

18:01.880 --> 18:04.781
I wish I can fall in love again.
I wish I can fall in love...

18:04.950 --> 18:06.508
I can keep going.

18:06.685 --> 18:10.314
I wish I can fall in love again.
I wish all my flowers can blossom.

18:10.456 --> 18:13.357
I wish for fried pork
cutlet tonight. I wish I can be...

18:13.525 --> 18:15.322
...more manly...

18:50.062 --> 18:52.553
Forgive me, earthling.

18:52.764 --> 18:55.597
Luckily, we were able
to save your life.

18:55.767 --> 18:56.734
But...

19:11.350 --> 19:14.251
Hey, Tomari!
Don't go on the side road!

19:14.386 --> 19:17.082
What's that sound I keep hearing?

19:28.700 --> 19:32.727
My speech has been converted into
your language, so I'm sure you can...

19:32.838 --> 19:35.170
...understand me
without any problems.

19:35.307 --> 19:41.405
We're what you call unclassified
life forms or simply aliens.

19:41.547 --> 19:43.242
Aliens...

19:55.394 --> 19:56.461
That face...

19:56.461 --> 19:58.088
That face...
H-H-Hazumu...

19:58.530 --> 19:59.622
Hazumu?

19:59.932 --> 20:00.864
Hazumu!

20:01.266 --> 20:02.324
Hazumu!

20:02.634 --> 20:04.168
Hazumu!

20:04.169 --> 20:05.796
Hazumu!
My student!

20:06.505 --> 20:09.997
We just came to this planet
to conduct research...

20:10.108 --> 20:13.077
...on psychological behavior
of level-5 life forms.

20:13.178 --> 20:17.740
But our ship had some mechanical
problems and injured this earthling.

20:17.983 --> 20:21.942
Therefore, according to the
interplanetary life preservation law...

20:22.120 --> 20:25.351
...we apologize by
revealing our existence.

20:25.524 --> 20:26.616
Injured?

20:28.627 --> 20:34.259
About this earthling, we did
restore his tissues completely, but...

20:34.433 --> 20:39.166
...we would like to apologize
for reversing his gender.

20:40.138 --> 20:43.938
He... I mean she is 100% female.

20:44.643 --> 20:47.544
It's impossible
to reverse this process.

20:47.846 --> 20:49.711
Impossible to reverse?

20:49.815 --> 20:51.806
But Hazumu is alive!

20:52.017 --> 20:53.507
That's great!

20:54.453 --> 20:58.514
See to it that this earthling
receives the proper human rights...

20:58.690 --> 21:01.625
...and blends in with this culture.

21:13.038 --> 21:14.528
Hazumu!

21:16.275 --> 21:17.333
Hazumu!

21:17.909 --> 21:19.069
Hey, Tomari!

21:50.208 --> 21:51.505
Hazumu?

21:51.843 --> 21:53.606
Hazumu...

21:54.279 --> 21:55.906
You must be kidding.

22:03.755 --> 22:05.222
Are you serious?

22:07.993 --> 22:11.360
Huh? Tomari, Yasuna...

22:11.830 --> 22:13.821
Your voice...

22:16.234 --> 22:18.702
What? Something wrong?

22:34.152 --> 22:41.615
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

22:42.661 --> 22:49.499
No matter where
you are, <i>I</i>'llfindyou.

22:50.802 --> 22:57.469
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

22:58.076 --> 23:02.513
Today is going to end,
and we can’t see tomorrow.

23:03.014 --> 23:05.710
But they'<i>ll</i> turn into a gentle color.

23:07.285 --> 23:13.815
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

23:14.226 --> 23:22.361
When I turn around,
I always see your smile.

23:23.568 --> 23:31.031
<i>I</i> wish a day like that would come.

23:31.209 --> 23:39.139
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

23:39.851 --> 23:46.313
I’m sending these great
feelings that never end...

23:46.558 --> 23:51.518
...straight to you.

24:02.007 --> 24:04.407
I turned into a girl all of a sudden.

24:04.543 --> 24:07.944
What? I have to wear a skirt
starting today? And the locker room?

24:08.046 --> 24:10.480
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:10.549 --> 24:13.347
The Girl Realizes That She is a Girl.

24:13.452 --> 24:15.943
These feelings... in my heart.
